--- test_quality_workflow
step | task | description | tools | validation | priority
1 | Read_File | Understand component/service | read_file | Understand logic | high
2 | Create_Tests | Write test cases | test framework | Tests compile | high
3 | Check_Errors | Verify typing | get_errors | No type errors | critical
4 | Execute_Tests | Run test suite | ng test | All pass | high
5 | Review_Results | Analyze output | test runner | Coverage adequate | medium
6 | Fix_Issues | Correct failures | editor | All resolved | high

--- test_structure_requirements
element | requirement | correct_format | incorrect_format | priority | reason
Describe_Wrapper | Use fdescribe | fdescribe('Name', () => {}) | describe('Name', () => {}) | critical | Focused testing
Test_Variables | No readonly in let | let component: Component | let readonly component | high | Variable scope
Mock_Objects | Create with spy | jasmine.createSpyObj() | Manual mock object | high | Consistency
Test_Setup | beforeEach config | beforeEach(async () => {}) | Direct initialization | high | Test isolation
Assertions | Include expectations | expect(x).toBe(y) | Untested code | high | Verification

--- readonly_in_tests_rules
scope | element_type | apply_readonly | reason | example
Class_Property | Subscription, Config | YES | Never reassigned | private readonly subscription = new Sub()
Test_Variable | let component, let fixture | NO | Variable scope | let component: ComponentName;
Const_Local | const in function | NO | Function scope | const mockData = { ... };
Service_Mock | jasmine.createSpyObj | NO | Created in beforeEach | let mockService: jasmine.SpyObj<Service>;
Constructor_Injection | DI parameter | YES | Class-level property | constructor(private readonly service: Service)

--- mocking_patterns_standard
mock_type | creation_method | example | assertions | usage_frequency
Service_Spy | jasmine.createSpyObj | spy('Service', ['method']) | expect(spy.method).toHaveBeenCalled() | very_high
BehaviorSubject | new BehaviorSubject() | new BehaviorSubject(value) | subject.next(newValue) | high
HttpClient | HttpTestingController | TestBed.inject(HttpTestingController) | controller.expectOne() | high
Component_Fixture | TestBed.createComponent | TestBed.createComponent(Component) | fixture.detectChanges() | very_high
Observable | of() or throwError() | of(data) or throwError(err) | subscribe and assert | high

--- test_execution_command_patterns
test_type | command | flags | example | expected_result
Single_File | ng test | --include | ng test --include="**/component.spec.ts" | 1+ tests pass
Suite | ng test | --browsers,--watch | ng test --browsers=ChromeHeadless --watch=false | All tests pass
Coverage | ng test | --code-coverage | ng test --code-coverage | coverage/* generated
Debug | ng test | (default browser) | ng test | Chrome debugging tools available
CI_Pipeline | ng test | --no-watch,--browsers=ChromeHeadless | ng test --no-watch --browsers=ChromeHeadless | Exit code 0

--- error_checking_workflow
step | task | command | tool | fix_priority | when_to_run
1 | Check_Typing | get_errors | typescript | critical | After every change
2 | Check_Imports | grep for unused | linter | high | During development
3 | Check_Syntax | tsc --noEmit | typescript | critical | Before commit
4 | Check_Tests | get_errors for *.spec.ts | typescript | critical | Before test run
5 | Fix_All | Run fixes | sonarqube | high | Before PR

--- test_import_optimization
check | applies_to | action | reason | example
Lifecycle_OnInit | Components | Remove if no ngOnInit() | Keep only used | Remove OnInit from import
Lifecycle_OnDestroy | Components | Remove if no ngOnDestroy() | Keep only used | Remove OnDestroy from import
Service_Import | Components/Services | Remove if not injected | Keep only used | Remove unused service import
Interface_Import | All | Remove if not implemented | Keep only used | Remove unused interface
Type_Import | All | Remove if not referenced | Keep only used | Remove unused type annotation
Unused_Variable | Tests | Remove | Keep only used | Remove unused let declarations
